cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Semantic Expression System"
abstract: >-
  A protocol-neutral architecture for separating interface meaning from interface
  expression. A single stable semantic interface definition can produce radically
  different rendered interfaces without duplicating application logic or fragmenting
  component behavior. This repository includes the specification, schemas, TypeScript
  types, conformance corpus, and evidence records.
